{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026FclAQjRxRp1793006296.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>第五屆國際金融領袖投資峰會將於下周舉行。</p><p></p><p>金管局總裁余偉文於專欄《匯思》提到，峰會將匯聚約280位國際金融領袖，包括約120位集團主席及行政總裁，進行高層次對話。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_JF.HKMA.RVO-1400.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026cLPU1gKGuC1793006302.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>本屆主題為「思變圖新、開拓新局」。文章指，儘管風險與挑戰疊加，金融市場仍保持韌性，甚至出現亢奮，要深思現行「遊戲規則」是否有效，還是風險與脆弱性正形成暗湧「擇機而爆」，金融領袖將討論宏觀經濟趨勢及金融市場變動等，為不同行業、資產和地區帶來的機遇與風險。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T10:00:44.282945+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":208,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T09:10:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T00:38:11.622305+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T09:58:09.710104+00:00","content_hash":"137a3632b45baeb1e8c2c99057c7be0a6be55ce1606b5952b85a2efbac13ff85","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T10:00:44.282945+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}